[[Open This|2. Policy scopes]]

---

Users and groups can be assigned roles on three kinds of resource: fleet, silo, or project. Each of those has its own role policy that can be viewed and modified through the API. Viewing a policy typically requires the viewer role on the resource, while updating a policy requires the admin role.